# AWS Data Exchange User Guide 

> Describes how to use AWS Data Exchange, the online marketplace where you can provide or subscribe to data in AWS.

- [What is AWS Data Exchange?](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/what-is.md)
- [Setting up](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/setting-up.md)
- [Data in AWS Data Exchange](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-sets.md)
- [Quotas](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/limits.md)
- [Document history](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/doc-history.md)

## [Using Open Data on AWS data sets](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/open-data.md)

- [Getting started using the AWS Data Exchange console](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/open-data-using-ADX-console.md): The following topics describe how you can find and use an Open Data on AWS data set on AWS Data Exchange by using the AWS Data Exchange console.
- [Getting started without an AWS account](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/open-data-no-account.md): The following topics describe how you can find and use Open Data on AWS data sets without an AWS account.


## [Creating data grants](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/creating-data-grants.md)

- [Containing file-based data](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/creating-a-data-grant-file-based-data.md): The following topics describe the process of creating a data set and a new data grant containing file-based data on AWS Data Exchange by using the AWS Data Exchange console.
- [Containing APIs](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/creating-a-data-grant-api.md): The following topics describe the process of creating a REST API data set and adding it to a data grant that contains APIs on AWS Data Exchange.
- [Containing Amazon Redshift data sets](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-grant-publish-Redshift-product.md): An Amazon Redshift data set contains AWS Data Exchange datashares for Amazon Redshift.
- [Containing Amazon S3 data access](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-grant-publish-s3-data-access-product.md): With AWS Data Exchange for Amazon S3, data owners can share direct access to Amazon S3 buckets or specific prefixes and Amazon S3 objects.
- [Containing AWS Lake Formation data permission data sets (Preview)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-grant-publish-LF-data-product.md): If you're interested in creating data grants containing AWS Lake Formation data permission data sets during this Preview, contact AWS Support.


