- [Containing APIs](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-grant-access-apis.md): The following topics describe the process of accessing a data set containing APIs on AWS Data Exchange using the AWS Data Exchange console.
- [Containing Amazon Redshift data sets](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-grant-access-redshift-data-sets.md): Overview for recipients
- [Containing Amazon S3 data access](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-grant-access-s3-data-sets.md): Overview for recipients
- [Containing AWS Lake Formation data sets (Preview)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-grant-access-lake-formation-data-sets.md): Overview for recipients

### [Sharing a data grant license in an organization](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/sharing-a-data-grant-license.md)

Learn how to share a data grant license in an organization.

- [Viewing your licenses](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-grant-viewing-licenses.md): The following topics explain how to view your AWS Data Exchange licenses.
- [Sharing your licenses](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/data-grant-sharing-license.md): Overview for receivers


## [Subscribing to data products](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribe-to-data-sets.md)

- [Product subscriptions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/product-subscriptions.md): Learn how to pay for AWS Data Exchange products that you subscribed to.
- [Getting started as a subscriber](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscriber-getting-started.md): Learn the process for becoming a data product subscriber on AWS Data Exchange.

### [Subscribing to a product](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribing-to-product.md)

Learn the process for subscribing to and accessing a product on AWS Data Exchange.

- [Containing file-based data](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribing-to-data-product.md): The following topics describe the complete process of subscribing to and accessing a product containing file-based data stored as files on AWS Data Exchange.
- [Containing APIs](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribing-to-API-product.md): The following topics describe the complete process of subscribing to and accessing a product containing APIs on AWS Data Exchange by using the AWS Data Exchange console.
- [Containing Amazon Redshift data sets](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribing-to-Redshift-product.md): Overview for recipients
- [Containing Amazon S3 data access](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribing-to-S3-data-access.md): AWS Data Exchange for Amazon S3 allows data subscribers to access third-party data files directly from data providers' Amazon S3 buckets.
- [Containing AWS Lake Formation data sets (Preview)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribing-to-LakeFormation-product.md): An AWS Lake Formation data set is a data set that contains AWS Lake Formation data permission assets.
- [Viewing and downloading a data dictionary](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/view-download-dictionaries.md): Providers can attach data dictionaries to all AWS Data Exchange products.

### [Subscription verification for subscribers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscription-verification-sub.md)

Guidance for subscription verification for subscribers.

- [Completing a subscription request](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/complete-sub-request.md): AWS Data Exchange public products require subscription verification.
- [Reviewing your pending subscription requests](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/review-pending-sub-requests.md): Review your pending subscriptions for AWS Data Exchange products that require subscription verification.
- [Email notifications](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/email-notifications-sub.md): You receive an email notification to your AWS account email address when your request is approved, declined, or when it expires.
- [Sharing license subscriptions in an organization](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/organizations-sharing.md): Learn about sharing the licenses for subscribed products in AWS Data Exchange with your AWS Organizations accounts.
- [BYOS offers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribe-to-byos-offer.md): Create a bring your own subscription (BYOS) offer.
- [Private products and offers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribe-to-private-offer.md): Learn how to accept a private offer.

### [Managing subscriptions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/managing-subscriptions.md)

How to manage your subscriptions to AWS Data Exchange products.

- [Viewing your subscriptions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/view-subscriptions.md): View your subscriptions through the AWS Data Exchange console.
- [Turning subscription auto-renewal on or off](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/turn-on-off-auto-renewal.md): Manage your subscription auto-renewals through the AWS Data Exchange console.
- [Unsubscribing from a product](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/unsubscribe-product.md): Use the AWS Data Exchange console to unsubscribe from a data product.

### [Products for learning about interacting with AWS Data Exchange](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/ex_products_subs.md)

AWS Data Exchange offers the following products that help subscribers understand how to subscribe to and interact with an AWS Data Exchange data product.

### [AWS Data Exchange Heartbeat](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/heartbeat.md)

Learn how to subscribe to a product by following this tutorial.

- [Subscribing to AWS Data Exchange Heartbeat](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/how-to-subscribe.md): The following procedure shows how to browse the AWS Data Exchange catalog to find and subscribe to AWS Data Exchange Heartbeat.

### [AWS Data Exchange for APIs](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscriber-tutorial-api-product.md)

Learn how to subscribe to a product that contains APIs by following this tutorial.

- [Subscribing to AWS Data Exchange for APIs (Test Product)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribe-to-API-test-product.md): The following procedure shows how to browse the AWS Data Exchange catalog to find and subscribe to AWS Data Exchange for APIs (Test Product).
- [Viewing the API](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/tutorial-view-api.md): You can view the API with AWS Data Exchange for APIs (Test Product) using the following steps.
- [Downloading the API specification](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/tutorial-download-api-spec.md): You can download the API specification with AWS Data Exchange for APIs (Test Product) using the following steps.
- [Making an API call](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/tutorial-make-api-call-console.md): You can call a single endpoint in the AWS Data Exchange console.

### [Worldwide Event Attendance](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscriber-tutorial-RS-product.md)

Learn how to subscribe to a product that contains an Amazon Redshift data set by following this tutorial.

- [Subscribing to Worldwide Event Attendance (Test Product)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribe-to-test-product.md): The following procedure shows how to browse the AWS Data Exchange catalog to find and subscribe to Worldwide Event Attendance (Test Product).
- [Querying Worldwide Event Attendance (Test Product) data with an Amazon Redshift cluster (console)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/query-RS-data-console.md): The following procedure shows how to set up and query the datashare using the Amazon Redshift console.
- [Querying Worldwide Event Attendance (Test Product) data on Amazon Redshift (SQL)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/query-RS-data-SQL.md): The following procedure shows how to set up and query the datashare using the SQL commands.

### [AWS Data Exchange for AWS Lake Formation (Preview)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscriber-tutorial-LF-product.md)

Learn how to subscribe to a product that contains Lake Formation data sets by following this tutorial.

- [Subscribing to AWS Data Exchange for AWS Lake Formation (Test Product) on AWS Data Exchange (Preview)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribe-to-LF-test-product.md): The following procedure shows how to browse the AWS Data Exchange catalog to find and subscribe to AWS Data Exchange for Lake Formation (Test Product). (Preview)
- [Setting up and querying AWS Data Exchange for Lake Formation (Test Product) (Preview)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/query-LF-data-console.md): The following procedure shows how to set up and query a Lake Formation data permission set (Preview) using the AWS Management Console.

### [AWS Data Exchange for Amazon S3](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscriber-tutorial-s3-product.md)

Learn how to subscribe to a product that contains an Amazon S3 data access data set by following this tutorial.

- [Subscribing to AWS Data Exchange for Amazon S3 (Test Product)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/subscribe-to-s3-test-product.md): The following procedure shows how to browse the AWS Data Exchange catalog to find and subscribe to AWS Data Exchange for Amazon S3 (Test Product).
- [Setting up and querying AWS Data Exchange for Amazon S3 (Test Product)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/data-exchange/latest/userguide/query-s3-data-access-cli.md): The following procedure shows how to set up and query an Amazon S3 data access data set using the AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI).

